{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6e7727496763027b9e11b6f019b7d570.avif?t=1762285570\" width=633 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is humanity\u2019s favorite thing? <br>That refreshing bubble tea after a big meal? <br>A heart-pounding horror movie? <br>Or maybe those cheesy old tourist spots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, enjoy them while you can\u2026 <br>Because the Demon Lord of the Apocalypse is coming! \ud83d\ude08\ud83d\udd25 <br>As ancient magic unfolds and the runes of destruction are written one by one, <br>all that humans hold dearest\u2014<br>all that they cannot bear to lose\u2014 <br>will be reduced to ashes in the flames of doom!! \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/7a4038d9c1e70311ebaf3ba022e5af3d.poster.avif?t=1762285570\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/7a4038d9c1e70311ebaf3ba022e5af3d.webm?t=1762285570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demon Lord, to unleash the ancient magic, <br>you must rotate, flip, and move the tiles around to fill the Ritual Scroll. <br>But most importantly, the tiles in your hand aren\u2019t enough. <br>Only by awakening those ridiculous skulls and having them help you unlock tiles of every shape <br>will you have any chance of overcoming the trials ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6c0a295152c0e6981bdb639402af97ba.webp?t=1762285570\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6c0a295152c0e6981bdb639402af97ba.poster.avif?t=1762285570\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=230 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just the tricky puzzles that make you frown. <br>Nagging Secretary, Noisy Twin, Gloomy Ghost\u2026 <br>and a whole host of other troublesome fools are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey of world destruction, only humanity\u2019s wails can offer you a small measure of comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uniquely designed levels that challenge your sense of space. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painstakingly crafted pixel art that brings out a bold, hell-inspired atmosphere. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witty storyline featuring a cast of absurd and unforgettable characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current translation is not yet perfect. Please forgive any mistakes or shortcomings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110760?t=1762285570","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/eceff2520d2812301daa3bee9cc5e80665d2a980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762285570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/aca00b1584f256246142b282d048bf2e553cbf74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762285570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/aca00b1584f256246142b282d048bf2e553cbf74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762285570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6e7727496763027b9e11b6f019b7d570.avif?t=1762285570\" width=633 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is humanity\u2019s favorite thing? <br>That refreshing bubble tea after a big meal? <br>A heart-pounding horror movie? <br>Or maybe those cheesy old tourist spots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, enjoy them while you can\u2026 <br>Because the Demon Lord of the Apocalypse is coming! \ud83d\ude08\ud83d\udd25 <br>As ancient magic unfolds and the runes of destruction are written one by one, <br>all that humans hold dearest\u2014<br>all that they cannot bear to lose\u2014 <br>will be reduced to ashes in the flames of doom!! \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/7a4038d9c1e70311ebaf3ba022e5af3d.poster.avif?t=1762285570\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/7a4038d9c1e70311ebaf3ba022e5af3d.webm?t=1762285570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demon Lord, to unleash the ancient magic, <br>you must rotate, flip, and move the tiles around to fill the Ritual Scroll. <br>But most importantly, the tiles in your hand aren\u2019t enough. <br>Only by awakening those ridiculous skulls and having them help you unlock tiles of every shape <br>will you have any chance of overcoming the trials ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6c0a295152c0e6981bdb639402af97ba.webp?t=1762285570\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/extras/6c0a295152c0e6981bdb639402af97ba.poster.avif?t=1762285570\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=230 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just the tricky puzzles that make you frown. <br>Nagging Secretary, Noisy Twin, Gloomy Ghost\u2026 <br>and a whole host of other troublesome fools are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey of world destruction, only humanity\u2019s wails can offer you a small measure of comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uniquely designed levels that challenge your sense of space. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painstakingly crafted pixel art that brings out a bold, hell-inspired atmosphere. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witty storyline featuring a cast of absurd and unforgettable characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current translation is not yet perfect. Please forgive any mistakes or shortcomings.</p>","developers":["ScaryLulus"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/4013d80206b65f65ec0978f50677289eeb9bc92b/header.jpg?t=1762285570","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110760/288665738/b45f65388b0c76785cffdabcad9e4e63b47cd848/1760469569/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762285568","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110760/288665738/b45f65388b0c76785cffdabcad9e4e63b47cd848/1760469569/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762285568","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic