2205558c6ff6ee15c4aac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762285570","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110760/4a7dfe3fecb6e9ff4032205558c6ff6ee15c4aac/ss_4a7dfe3fecb6e9ff4032205558c6ff6ee15c4aac.600x338.jpg?t=1762285570"}],"short_description":"Snaip of Doomsday is a puzzle game that starts with the Demon Lord\u2019s wicked idea to \u201cdestroy the world.\u201d Step into the role of Demon Lord Snaip, unravel ancient magic amidst an apocalyptic farce, and lay waste to the everyday joys that humans hold most dear.","steam_appid":4110760,"support_info":{"email":"scarylulus@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","type":"game","website":"https://sites.google.com/view/scarylulus"}